@kimmonismus I tried it. Searching was nice, but the agent mode is a total gimmick.

I actually almost felt bad watching it try to just add a protein powder to my cart on a (very popular) supplements website.

Didn’t get enough value for me to switch.

@kimmonismus Fixing the browser is like trying to make better standard for trains to run on, no leave the trains on the existing rails and lets focus on the planes. 

Browser = rails
Assistant = planes

@kimmonismus Before you get the best out of an AI browser, you need AI websites

Human websites and AI browsers don’t work

AI websites + AI browsers = Magic ✨

@kimmonismus Atlas feels like the browser finally caught up to the AI era.
Context, memory, assistance — built right in.
The only question: can OpenAI make it powerful without making it creepy? 👀
